# Cloudflare Pages Headers
/*
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-XSS-Protection: 1; mode=block
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data: https:; frame-src 'self' https://challonge.com; connect-src 'self' https://script.google.com https://api.cloudinary.com https://open.faceit.com https://api.steampowered.com;
